      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOL",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "The meal offering and the drink offering are cut off from the LORD’s house. The priests, the LORD’s ministers, mourn.",
      "ko": "소제와 전제가 여호와의 전에 끊어졌고 여호와께 수종드는 제사장은 슬퍼하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "36b24a9484eaad87f7c263eeb89cd28b1ecb7aea54174ab857d835fcbc9a5a32",
      "translation_text_hash": "6fb840f4609b2d77525e086a292023471d2fa26a6833cf6bf70d0e39c64ec5ca",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "소제와 전제가 여호와의 전에 끊어졌고 여호와께 수종드는 제사장은 슬퍼하도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6fb840f4609b2d77525e086a292023471d2fa26a6833cf6bf70d0e39c64ec5ca"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOL:1:10",
      "sequence": 22302,
      "chapter_label": "JOL 1",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
        "book": "JOL",
